# Technical vocabulary handed to the Whisper decoder through `hotwords`.
#
# One term per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# The file is re-read on every transcription: an edit takes effect immediately,
# without restarting the daemon.
#
# Why it matters: unbiased, Whisper transcribes "IaC" as "Igacé" and
# "git worktree" as "Gitworktree" in French speech. With these terms declared,
# both come out right, for a measured cost of 0.2 s.
#
# Copy to ~/.config/hushkeys/vocabulary.txt and adapt.

IaC
GitOps
Kubernetes
Ansible
Terraform
Helm
ArgoCD
CI/CD
BDD
git worktree
rebase
fetch
pull request
merge
Rust
React
